# Training Asset Standards

When creating or editing materials in this folder:

1. **Language:** 繁體中文書面語（面向學員的說明、講義）；正式會議紀錄／表格亦用書面語
2. **Demos:** Prefer error-free, copy-paste-ready prompts and sample transcripts
3. **Minutes format:** Use columns 議項 / 內容摘要 / 跟進人員·部門 / 限期 when showing school-format output
4. **Metaphors over jargon:** Explain `@` 引用 as giving the AI intern the right filing cabinet — not vector databases
